SUMMARY:The Creative Playground
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\nTHE CREATIVE PLAYGROUND wi
 th Astra Fox\, special guest Christi Corradi\n\nA free monthly gathering \
 \~ every 4th Monday \\~ 7–8 PM PST \\~ live on Zoom\nOne sacred hour for
  your creative soul.\nNo experience needed. No pressure. Just play.\n\n✦
  Tap into your intuition\n✦ Clear creative blocks that have been holding
  you back\n✦ Deepen your connection to your gifts\n✦ Receive inspirati
 on and energetic downloads\n✦ Create\, share\, and be truly seen\n✦ Ra
 ise your vibration and creative confidence\n✦ Connect with kindred souls
  who get it\n\nAstra Fox welcomes Full Circle Studio's Christi Corradi \\~
  Intuitive Artist\, Teacher\, Speaker\, Global Traveler \\~ to guide our C
 reative Play practice with Neurographic Art.\n\nNeurographic Art bridges t
 he conscious and unconscious mind \\~ sparking new neural pathways and dis
 solving old\, limiting patterns.\n\nInspired by Dr. Pavel Piskarev\, Carl 
 Jung\, and Zentangle's Rick Roberts & Maria Thomas \\~ with a special twis
 t from Christi's own method that adds a surprise layer of meaning.\nAll yo
 u need to bring:\n✦ A pen\n✦ Paper\n✦ An open heart\n\n💻 Free \\~
  Live on Zoom\n\n👉 Register here: https://www.eventbrite.com/e/the-crea
 tive-playground-tickets-1986926631040\n\n🎥 24hr replay available when y
 ou register\n\n#TheCreativePlayground #NeurographicArt #CreativeAlchemy #T
 hrivingCreator #WorthyCreator
