SUMMARY:Wacky Chickens or Gnomes
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n**Wacky Chickens or Gnomes
  – 2-Day Event Aug 8 & 22nd**\n***💰 Cost: $65 (all materials)***\n\n
 📅 **Dates:** Aug 8 & 22\, 2026\n📍 **Location:** Full Circle Studio\,
  360 Tesconi Circle Ste C\, Santa Rosa\, CA\n👥 **Ages:** 16+\n\nJoin us
  for a hands-on clay workshop at **Full Circle Studio 360!** In this two-d
 ay event\, you'll make your Gnome or Chicken on Aug. 8. And glaze on Aug. 
 22nd. You get to choose from one of the two projects.\n\nThis is a great o
 pportunity to explore your creativity\, meet fellow art lovers\, and take 
 home a unique handmade piece! No prior experience needed.\n\n🎟️ **Lim
 ited spots available – reserve your space today!**
